AnnotationBreakpoint is distributed under the MIT license in LICENSE and LICENSE.md.

The release imports installed R packages through their public namespaces:
edgeR 4.6.3 (GPL >= 2), Matrix 1.7.4 (GPL >= 2), digest 0.6.37
(GPL >= 2), jsonlite 2.0.0 (MIT), and yaml 2.3.10 (BSD 3-clause).
Tests use testthat 3.2.3 (MIT). edgeR uses limma 3.64.3 (GPL >= 2).

No implementation code from the scientific comparator repositories inspected
during methods review was copied into this package. Those projects remain
citations and context only. The installed example tables are synthetic project
fixtures generated for Annotation Breakpoint and are bound to their original
paths and SHA-256 hashes in inst/extdata/examples/provenance.tsv.
